#: src/features/games/junqi/JunqiHelp.tsx:47
msgid "50 枚棋子随机盖放在非行营位置，行营为空。先翻者取得首枚棋子的阵营，另一方取相反阵营；翻到军旗或地雷也能定边。盖子不能移动或被攻击，会阻挡道路；任何一方都可翻开，每次消耗一个回合。"
msgstr "All 50 pieces are shuffled face down onto non-camp spaces. Camps start empty. The first revealed piece assigns its side to the player who revealed it, even if it is a flag or mine. The other player takes the opposite side. Covered pieces block movement and cannot move or be attacked. Either player may reveal one, using a turn."

#: src/features/games/billiards/BilliardsHelp.tsx:115
